		},
		{
			"id": "b42238f2fdc694a0",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/41-Forwarding Unit.png",
			"x": -999,
			"y": 4135,
			"width": 488,
			"height": 280
		},
		{
			"id": "1cf2d6ed568d2b32",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/28-Hazard Detection Unit.png",
			"x": 1761,
			"y": 3701,
			"width": 495,
			"height": 291
		},
		{
			"id": "39d075851baf3e53",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/40-Hazard Detection Unit.png",
			"x": 1761,
			"y": 4101,
			"width": 501,
			"height": 299
		},
		{
			"id": "3e8a78728adb7f92",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "```\nif (EX.MemRead==1) and ((EX.Rt==ID.Rs) or (EX.Rt==ID.Rt)) then\n    PCWrite=0; IFIDWrite=0; ControlMux=NOP   # stall 1 拍\n```",
			"x": 839,
			"y": 4755,
			"width": 616,
			"height": 115,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "6bf55278f440c39e",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/47-Hazard Detection Unit.png",
			"x": 1761,
			"y": 4900,
			"width": 501,
			"height": 288
		},
		{
			"id": "9035d22d1b5d1a98",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/44-Hazard Detection Unit.png",
			"x": 1761,
			"y": 4480,
			"width": 494,
			"height": 284
		},
		{
			"id": "a26707663758d051",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/27-Hazard Detection Unit.png",
			"x": 925,
			"y": 3701,
			"width": 515,
			"height": 291
		},
		{
			"id": "354e65166d994c1f",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "```\n# ForwardA for EX.Rs\nif (MEM.RegWrite==1) and (MEM.Rd!=0) and (MEM.Rd==EX.Rs) then\n    ForwardA = 10   # EX/MEM 優先\nelse if (WB.RegWrite==1) and (WB.Rd!=0) and (WB.Rd==EX.Rs) then\n    ForwardA = 01   # MEM/WB 次之\nelse\n    ForwardA = 00   # 原本ID/EX輸入\n\n# ForwardB for EX.Rt\nif (MEM.RegWrite==1) and (MEM.Rd!=0) and (MEM.Rd==EX.Rt) then\n    ForwardB = 10\nelse if (WB.RegWrite==1) and (WB.Rd!=0) and (WB.Rd==EX.Rt) then\n    ForwardB = 01\nelse\n    ForwardB = 00\n```",
			"x": -314,
			"y": 4755,
			"width": 866,
			"height": 418,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "4fe3fc6d1975f1f8",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## 為什麼會有 Forwarding Unit？\n\n- Pipeline 裡的 **data dependency (RAW)**：後一條指令要讀一個暫存器，而這個暫存器剛被前一條指令寫。\n    \n- 如果照正常流程，要等前一條進 WB 才能讀，但這樣會 stall。\n    \n- 但事實上，結果在前一條的 **EX** 或 **MEM** 階段就算好了，可以直接「繞道」送給下一條 EX。\n    \n- 這個動作就是 **forwarding**。\n    \n\n👉 **Forwarding Unit 的工作**：  \n對 EX 階段的來源暫存器 `Rs`、`Rt` 去檢查：\n\n- **EX/MEM 階段**是否正要寫相同暫存器？\n    \n    - 是 → 從 EX/MEM 直接送過來。\n        \n- 否的話，再檢查 **MEM/WB 階段**。\n    \n    - 是 → 從 MEM/WB 送過來。\n        \n- 兩邊都沒有 → 用寄存器檔原本的值。",
			"x": -296,
			"y": 4141,
			"width": 831,
			"height": 396
		},
		{
			"id": "0dd2ced0d3301b43",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/12-instr. reording.png",
			"x": -79,
			"y": 2459,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 377
		},
		{
			"id": "3ec800ae5885a97d",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/15-instr. reording.png",
			"x": -79,
			"y": 2940,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 224
		},
		{
			"id": "5b763042c3ffee58",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/08-instr. reording.png",
			"x": 551,
			"y": 2094,
			"width": 399,
			"height": 230
		},
		{
			"id": "5389bada598ec1d6",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "lw 已經要 WB 所以不會跟 IF 撞到",
			"x": 2382,
			"y": 630,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 50
		},
		{
			"id": "d5e02f6e035d06f1",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/05-Structural hazard - lw 已經要 WB 所以不會跟 IF 撞到.png",
			"x": 1902,
			"y": 540,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 236
		},
		{
			"id": "f854dc628301c3fa",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "所以只要放一個 NOP 就可以解決此問題",
			"x": 2411,
			"y": 980,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 60
		},
		{
			"id": "e69fac010d82d803",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/06-Structural hazard - 所以只要放一個 NOP 就可以解決此問題.png",
			"x": 1902,
			"y": 900,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 229
		},
		{
			"id": "20f4ba36485f2b48",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## 為什麼還要 Hazard Detection Unit？\n\n- ==Forwarding 幾乎能解大部分 RAW hazard，但 **load-use hazard 例外**，其實就是 load 相關指令後面有 hazard==\n    \n- 因為 load (`lw/lh/lb`) 要到 **MEM 結束**才真的把資料讀回來。\n    \n- 下一條馬上要用，EX 階段時資料還沒出來，forwarding 根本沒東西可送。\n    \n\n👉 **Hazard Detection Unit 的工作**：\n\n- 檢查「EX 階段是不是 load，且它的目標暫存器 = ID 階段的來源暫存器」。\n    \n- 如果是 → stall pipeline 一拍：\n    \n    - PC 不更新。\n        \n    - IF/ID latch 不更新。\n        \n    - ID/EX 插一條 NOP。\n        \n- 等到 load 把資料讀回，再透過 forwarding 傳給後面。",
			"x": 854,
			"y": 4141,
			"width": 586,
			"height": 398
		},
		{
			"id": "6a40c5d2d90a0fcc",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- **RAW**：最常見，也是我們一直在講的 load-use hazard → stall / forwarding 解。\n\t\n- **WAW**：兩條指令寫同一個暫存器，可能覆蓋掉 → in-order pipeline 很少有影響，但在亂序執行 (out-of-order) 要特別小心。\n\t\n- **WAR**：只有在 out-of-order pipeline 才會出現。\n\t\n- 檢查相依方式\n\t\n\t- **Check 1**：你的目的暫存器 (Dest) 有沒有被後面拿來當來源 (Source)？ → RAW\n\n\t- **Check 2**：你的來源暫存器 (Source) 有沒有依賴前面某人的目的暫存器 (Dest)？ → RAW\n\t\t\n\t- **Check 3**：你的目的暫存器 (Dest) 會不會被後面的目的暫存器覆蓋掉？ → WAW",
			"x": 381,
			"y": 2452,
			"width": 740,
			"height": 243
		},
		{
			"id": "e015376d5390530a",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- **理想情況**：透過 **instruction reordering**（把不相依的指令調換順序），就能避免 data hazard，而不用多插 NOP。這樣 pipeline 可以保持滿載，CPI 最小化。\n    \n- **現實限制**：不是所有程式都有「足夠獨立的指令」可以拿來重排。例如：\n    \n    - 指令之間高度相依，怎麼排都會卡在 load-use hazard。\n        \n    - 程式語意限制（例如順序不可改動），也不能亂 reorder。\n        \n- **最後手段**：如果真的找不到可以重排的指令，就只能插入 **NOP**，讓 pipeline 停一拍（或多拍），保證資料正確性，但代價是效能下降。",
			"x": -159,
			"y": 3240,
			"width": 600,
			"height": 238,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "5ca00ae470501d81",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/07-instr. reording.png",
			"x": -79,
			"y": 2069,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 280
		},
		{
			"id": "74ae722287c1bf63",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/01-Structural hazard.png",
			"x": 1902,
			"y": -780,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 230
		},
		{
			"id": "991f2c192a4cc170",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/02-Structural hazard - 加一個 NOP.png",
			"x": 1902,
