			"width": 474,
			"height": 262
		},
		{
			"id": "92808d4465babf4d",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/39-delayed branching.png",
			"x": 7686,
			"y": 4060,
			"width": 474,
			"height": 210
		},
		{
			"id": "6e8bd47bcef691ff",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/46-delayed branching.png",
			"x": 8210,
			"y": 4566,
			"width": 398,
			"height": 85
		},
		{
			"id": "2eabcd6cdd472ba6",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 這邊會有另一個問題，就是如果今天 branch 也是在 ID2 解碼的話那麼他也會繼續抓指令但是，他後面如果是猜對了那麼 ID1 ID2 EXE1 是抓錯的指令需要砍掉但是 IF1 IF2 是抓對的，因為 IF1 是跳躍目的的指令 ，IF2 是猜跳後的第一個指令\n- 反之如果是猜錯了那麼就是就是後面要刪掉 IF1 IF2\n- 課本就是 branch 可以猜但是 JMP 指令不行猜",
			"x": 8200,
			"y": 4292,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 209
		},
		{
			"id": "5ed8b80738a0f1a6",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/68-猜不跳不對.png",
			"x": 8266,
			"y": 7318,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 225
		},
		{
			"id": "b473c3e379ccf18c",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/78-猜不跳不對.png",
			"x": 8259,
			"y": 7970,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 231
		},
		{
			"id": "14cd3f90613fd275",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/74-猜不跳不對.png",
			"x": 8259,
			"y": 7650,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 225
		},
		{
			"id": "ea7b452c02af44f5",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "猜錯，所以應該是要抓 beq 指令的後面，才對所以設定成 3 就是抓 beq 正後面也就是 sw 才對那麼不用在重新加 4 因為前面已經加好了，並且要把錯誤指令清空所以 IF.Flush = 1",
			"x": 8822,
			"y": 7558,
			"width": 297,
			"height": 145,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "73a4b1a96a124500",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "不跳，但是猜錯",
			"x": 8749,
			"y": 7065,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "3259a55b4bb2b1b2",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/77-猜不跳對 - 沒有要跳所以抓原本下一行要抓的指令.png",
			"x": 7359,
			"y": 7930,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 231
		},
		{
			"id": "3ef27dd7a344c1a7",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 4:1 MUX 的狀態\n\t- 3 直接抓 beq 後面的指令也就是不用再加四因為加過了\n\t- 2 把 beq(PC 這邊已經先加過 4 也就是抓一次指令了) 的結果在加一次 4 後給 PC\n\t- 1 就是正常送一次 +4\n\t- 0 就是什麼都不動再送一次\n",
			"x": 7709,
			"y": 6511,
			"width": 487,
			"height": 190,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "916c857a1f631626",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/53-Dynamic branch predictio - BTB 和 BHT 定義.png",
			"x": 7245,
			"y": 6170,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 229
		},
		{
			"id": "15aceb9cc062b911",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/54-Dynamic branch predictio - 4 1 MUX 的狀態.png",
			"x": 7238,
			"y": 6490,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 231
		},
		{
			"id": "bbd3baf57ea9a2b7",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## BTB 和 BHT 定義\nbht：branch history table\n小型記憶體結構，用分支指令位址低位元索引，儲存 1-bit 或 2-bit 計數器，表示該分支「上次」是 taken 還是 not taken。它提供分支方向的預測。\n\nbtb：branch target buffer\n類似快取的結構，存放分支目標位址 (target pc)。如果 bht 預測為 taken，就從 btb 直接取出跳轉位址，避免等到解碼或執行階段才計算。\n\n差異：\nbht 管方向（跳或不跳),btb 管目標（跳去哪裡)",
			"x": 7091,
			"y": 5750,
			"width": 708,
			"height": 305,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "c147ece7098923d7",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/29-delayed branching - 挑選安全指令.png",
			"x": 6521,
			"y": 3721,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 230
		},
		{
			"id": "cfc437ceaa01b3db",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/37-delayed branching - 挑選安全指令.png",
			"x": 6521,
			"y": 4007,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 239
		},
		{
			"id": "8851a6693455f539",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/38-delayed branching.png",
			"x": 7079,
			"y": 4027,
			"width": 399,
			"height": 243
		},
		{
			"id": "4a069bfe4b197733",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/31-delayed branching.png",
			"x": 7030,
			"y": 3759,
			"width": 498,
			"height": 192
		},
		{
			"id": "2e801b7db7938ab5",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 如果用 Delayed branch 題目有說到一定會有足夠的安全指令所以不會有逞罰\n- 猜跳\n\t- 是 5，因為「錯猜」代價 = 2 + 3。\n\t\t\n\t- 2：分支指令在到達 ID1 前，IF1、IF2 已先把順序路徑的 I+1、I+2 取回。若你採「猜跳」，在 ID1 算出目標就改抓目標，這兩條序路指令被丟掉；若實際不跳，I+1、I+2 需要重抓，等於白費 2 個 cycle。\n\t    \n\t- 3：分支方向要到 EXE2 才知道。從你在 ID1 依「猜的路徑」開始取指，到 EXE2 才發現猜錯，ID2、EXE1、EXE2 這三個 stage 中灌進來的錯路徑指令都要 flush，空轉 3 個 cycle。\n\t\t\n\t- JMP，所以後面的指令就要刪掉那在他後面有 3 個指令就需要殺掉",
			"x": 7440,
			"y": 4321,
			"width": 680,
			"height": 288
		},
		{
			"id": "2a0d4fc7a13ab161",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/69-猜跳且猜對 - 所以 BTB 的內容進去也就是 SW.png",
			"x": 5479,
			"y": 7330,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 227
		},
		{
			"id": "7be4e51370830790",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_8_Pipeline_hazard_Control_hazard/33-delayed branching - 這圖要會畫.png",
			"x": 5100,
